    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University (AKU) and the Government of Gilgit-Baltistan (GB) have signed an agreement to improve the quality of teaching practices in GB schools. The agreement was signed under the guidance of AKU's President Dr Sulaiman Shahabuddin.",
